{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269ScLww2FMA1795418447.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>沙田豪宅區二手交投平穩。美聯物業沙田豪宅 – 新九肚山分行高級營業經理張銘新表示，該行最新促成玖瓏山一個946實呎單位成交，獲本地區內上車客以1120萬元承接。</p><p><br/>張銘新表示，成交單位為玖瓏山傲瓏閣3座高層D室，實用面積約946平方呎，附有豪華裝修。據了解，買家為本地區內上車客，購入單位自住，以1120萬元承接，折合實用呎價約11,839元。</p><p><br/>資料顯示，原業主於2014年11月以約1169.47萬元一手購入上述物業，持貨約12年，帳面蝕讓約49.47萬元，貶值約4.2%。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.295552+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":237,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T10:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T14:57:17.957591+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:17.467498+00:00","content_hash":"ae14c89911c5784c3ea8c1ad15f64d67555303b6c6ad5fef8d28b2689bfe903c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.295552+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}